+ * EWMH defines _NET_CLIENT_LIST_STACKING as the same set as _NET_CLIENT_LIST
+ * in a different order, so deriving it is also the more faithful reading.
+ *
+ * Deciding independently is what the code used to do, and it cannot be made
+ * safe by matching the conditions up: AddWindow() puts a window into the OTP
+ * list -- which restacks, which rebuilds this property -- BEFORE
+ * HandleMapRequest() gets to the EwmhAddClientWindow() call on the next line.
