+ *     Incorrect number of stacked windows: 4 (expected 3)
+ *
+ * A linear scan per window is O(n^2) over the whole walk, which for a screen's
+ * worth of windows is a few hundred comparisons on an event that already does
+ * a round trip to the server.
+ */
+static bool EwmhOnClientList(Window w)
+{
